<%- include('../partials/header') %><a class="breadcrumb" href="/kitchen" data-journey="right">← THE KITCHEN BOARD</a><div class="room-heading compact-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">レシピ · Per serving</p><h1><%= dish.name %></h1></div><span class="status-tag"><%= dish.recipe?'Recipe version '+dish.recipe.version:'New recipe' %></span></div><div class="recipe-layout"><section class="recipe-panel" data-paper-sheet><p class="eyebrow">SANTAISHI-TEI / RECIPE SHEET</p><h2><%= dish.name %></h2><p>Add an ingredient, set the quantity, or remove it from this dish. Save the recipe when you’re ready.</p><% if(error){ %><p class="error" role="alert"><%= error %></p><% } %><% const values=input || dish.recipe || {}; const submitted=input?([input.ingredientId].flat().map((id,index)=>({ingredientId:id,quantity:[input.quantity].flat()[index],notes:[input.itemNotes].flat()[index]}))):null; %><form method="post" action="/kitchen/dishes/<%= dish.id %>/recipe"><input type="hidden" name="_csrf" value="<%= csrf %>"><input type="hidden" name="version" value="<%= input?input.version:dish.recipe?.version || 0 %>"><label>Preparation notes<textarea name="instructions" rows="4" placeholder="How does this dish come together?"><%= values.instructions || '' %></textarea></label><div class="minute-fields"><label>Preparation · minutes<input name="preparationMinutes" type="number" min="0" value="<%= values.preparationMinutes ?? '' %>"></label><label>Cooking · minutes<input name="cookingMinutes" type="number" min="0" value="<%= values.cookingMinutes ?? '' %>"></label></div><table><thead><tr><th>Ingredient</th><th>Per serving</th><th>Note</th><th>Include</th></tr></thead><tbody><% ingredients.forEach(i=>{const item=(submitted || dish.recipe?.items || []).find(x=>x.ingredientId===i.id);const included=Number(item?.quantity || 0)>0; %><tr data-recipe-row class="<%= included?'ingredient-in-recipe':'' %>"><td><strong><%= i.name %></strong><small><%= i.baseUnit %> · <%= i.quantityOnHand.toString() %> on shelf<%= !i.isActive?' · inactive':'' %></small><input type="hidden" name="ingredientId" value="<%= i.id %>"></td><td><input aria-label="Quantity for <%= i.name %>" name="quantity" type="number" min="0" step="0.001" value="<%= item?.quantity?.toString() || '' %>"></td><td><input aria-label="Notes for <%= i.name %>" name="itemNotes" maxlength="250" value="<%= item?.notes || '' %>"></td><td><button class="ingredient-toggle" type="button" data-recipe-toggle aria-pressed="<%= included?'true':'false' %>" aria-label="Toggle <%= i.name %> in recipe"><%= included?'Remove':'Add' %></button></td></tr><% }) %></tbody></table><p class="muted-copy">A blank or zero quantity excludes an ingredient. Save recipe changes separately from recording stock usage.</p><button>Save recipe ↗</button></form></section><aside class="usage-panel"><p class="eyebrow">From recipe to preparation</p><h2>Record kitchen usage.</h2><% if(usageError){ %><p class="error" role="alert"><%= usageError %></p><% } %><% if(dish.recipe?.items.length){ %><p>Choose the number of servings. Review the ingredients that will leave the pantry.</p><form method="post" action="/kitchen/dishes/<%= dish.id %>/usage"><input type="hidden" name="_csrf" value="<%= csrf %>"><input type="hidden" name="requestKey" value="<%= requestKey %>"><input type="hidden" name="recipeVersion" value="<%= dish.recipe.version %>"><label>Servings<input name="servings" type="number" min="1" max="10000" value="<%= usageInput?.servings || 1 %>" required data-servings></label><ul class="usage-preview"><% dish.recipe.items.forEach(item=>{const ingredient=ingredients.find(i=>i.id===item.ingredientId); %><li><span><%= ingredient?.name || 'Archived ingredient' %></span><strong><span data-recipe-cost="<%= item.quantity.toString() %>"><%= item.quantity.toString() %></span> <%= ingredient?.baseUnit || '' %></strong></li><% }) %></ul><label>Reason<input name="reason" value="<%= usageInput?.reason || '' %>" required maxlength="2000" placeholder="e.g. Evening preparation"></label><button class="full-button">Record usage ↗</button></form><% }else{ %><p>Add and save ingredients before recording preparation usage.</p><% } %><p class="muted-copy">Usage records use the saved recipe. Stock history is preserved.</p></aside></div><%- include('../partials/footer') %>